The dish looks like a small white bowl, roughly 15 cm across. It holds a few dumplings, probably 3-4 wide wrapper-style dumplings, with sauce, chili oil and herbs on top.

Dumplings at about 25 g each come to roughly 100 g, and the sauce adds about 30 g, so the total is around 130-150 g. At roughly 1.6 kcal/g for dumplings plus some oil, that is about 220 kcal.

